## Interface: 16001
## Title: Glowey's |cffa335eeRecipes|r (DaylightUI Plugin)
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\DaylightRecipes\Media\icon.png
## Notes: A plugin for Daylight UI: a compact profession window with your recipes, their material costs, skill-up chance and sale value, a Leveling Guide, a crafting queue and every recipe you don't know yet with where to get it, and a thin strip at vendors, trainers and the Auction House with what to buy or learn. Uses DaylightMogul's prices when it's loaded.
## Author: Glowey
## X-License: GPL-3.0-or-later
